ReDet

ReDet: https://github.com/csuhan/ReDet
MMRotate: https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmrotate
MMDetection: https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection
MMCV: https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmcv
e2cnn: https://github.com/QUVA-Lab/e2cnn

The cascade code adapts the OpenMMLab MMRotate implementation (Apache-2.0).
CPU-oriented pooling adapts the MMCV RiRoIAlignRotated operator (Apache-2.0).
This distribution includes a custom feature pyramid and cascade configuration.

Rotated detection metrics adapt the ProbIoU, matching and AP equations in Ultralytics.
These components are distributed under AGPL-3.0. See LICENSE-Ultralytics.
https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics

The bundled MMRotate 0.3.4 source retains the runtime modules used by this detector.
Package imports are adapted for this distribution. See LICENSE.
